"sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NH"},{"bioguideId":"J000312","fullName":"Sen. Justice, James C. [R-WV]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-04-10","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"WV"},{"bioguideId":"G000574","fullName":"Sen. Gallego, Ruben [D-AZ]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-06-27","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"AZ"},{"bioguideId":"H001061","fullName":"Sen. Hoeven, John [R-ND]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-06-27","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"ND"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-17T05:22:25+00:00","id":"s317-119","introducedDate":"2025-01-29","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-01-29","text":"Read twice and referred to the Committee on Finance."},"laws":[],"number":"317","originChamber":"Senate","policyArea":"Taxation","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"L000575","district":null,"fullName":"Sen. Lankford, James [R-OK]","party":"R","state":"OK"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-01-29","actionDesc":"Introduced in Senate","text":"<p><strong>Charitable Act</strong></p><p>This bill allows an individual taxpayer who does not itemize their tax deductions to claim a tax deduction for charitable contributions and eliminates the tax penalty for overstating charitable contributions. (Some limitations apply).</p><p>Under the bill, for tax years beginning in 2026 or 2027, an individual taxpayer who does not itemize their tax deductions may deduct charitable contributions of up to one-third of the standard deduction allowed to such individual. (Under current law, an individual taxpayer generally must itemize their tax deductions to deduct charitable contributions.)</p><p>The bill also eliminates the tax penalty for an underpayment of taxes attributable to overstated charitable contributions by taxpayers who do not itemize deductions. (Under current law, taxpayers who claim a deduction under this bill may be assessed a tax penalty in the amount of 50% of the portion of an understatement of tax liability attributable to overstated charitable contributions.)</p>","updateDate":"2025-06-03T11:56:18Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Charitable Act","type":"s","updateDate":"2025-12-05T21:59:08Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2025-12-05T21:59:08Z"}
